{"type":"plan","title":"夏休みの風鈴","logline":"おばあちゃんの風鈴が再び鳴る夜、ゆいの願いが叶う物語","shots":[{"index":1,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Wide view of the machiya veranda in bright summer daylight; yui walks up the stone path toward the open veranda, the garden green behind her.","mode":"still","dialogue":"夏休み、ゆいは、京都のおばあちゃんの家に、遊びに来ました。","cites":[6]},{"index":2,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Medium shot of the veranda showing the silent Edo wind chime hanging from its bamboo rod; grandma stands nearby, hands folded, looking at it.","mode":"still","dialogue":"縁側には、古い江戸風鈴が、ひとつ下がっていますが、もう、音が鳴りません。","cites":[1,4]},{"index":3,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Close‑up on grandma’s face as she points to the wind chime, telling its story; the chime glints in the soft light.","mode":"still","dialogue":"「おじいちゃんと買った風鈴なの」と、おばあちゃんは、言いました。","cites":[1]},{"index":4,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Wide evening view of the lantern‑lit festival street; yui and grandma in yukata stroll past rows of stalls, paper lanterns glowing at dusk.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"夕方、二人は、浴衣を着て、祇園祭の宵山へ、出かけました。","cites":[5]},{"index":5,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Medium shot of the stall line; yui looks right toward a wind‑chime stall, lantern light flickering on her face.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"提灯の灯る通りには、屋台が、ずらりと並んでいます。","cites":[5]},{"index":6,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Close‑up on the wind‑chime stall; yui’s hand holds a blue tanzaku strip she just chose, the stall’s furin glimmer behind.","mode":"still","dialogue":"風鈴の屋台で、ゆいは、青い短冊を、一枚選びました。","cites":[2,4]},{"index":7,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Medium shot inside the machiya at night; yui sits at a low table, writing a wish on the blue tanzaku by lantern light.","mode":"still","dialogue":"夜、家に帰ると、ゆいは、短冊に、願いごとを書きました。","cites":[6]},{"index":8,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Close‑up on the tanzaku showing the handwritten wish: “おばあちゃんの風鈴が、また、鳴りますように”.","mode":"still","dialogue":"「おばあちゃんの風鈴が、また、鳴りますように」。","cites":[2]},{"index":9,"shotType":"Low angle","description":"Low‑angle view from the veranda floor as yui kneels to tie the tanzaku to the wind chime; a gentle night breeze stirs the paper.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"ゆいが、短冊を風鈴に結ぶと、夜風が、そっと吹きました。","cites":[1,3,4]},{"index":10,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Close‑up on the wind chime as it rings “ちりん” for the first time in years; yui looks left toward the sound, eyes wide.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"ちりん。風鈴が、ひさしぶりに、鳴りました。","cites":[1,3,4]},{"index":11,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Medium shot of grandma gently wiping a tear and patting yui’s head on the veranda; the wind chime sways softly in the background.","mode":"still","dialogue":"おばあちゃんは、そっと涙をふいて、ゆいの頭を、なでました。","cites":[1]}]}
